{"c":[{"id":"2d6dee9b8d77a730","sum":"Root uv lock: --no-config --refresh; CI uv 0.12.22 (lock rev 5; 0.8.22 rewrites to 3), bump only with a refresh. 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: --harness/--role rank the joined set, no WHERE on the LIMIT query. Semantic ids before role (2.0.0).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c55e5c34ee713bca","sum":"Root uv lock needs --no-config --refresh (--locked alone accepts a pytorch-index lock). CI pins uv 0.12.22; lock --refresh writes revision 5, and uv 0.8.22 rewrites it to 3. Bump that pin only with a refresh from 0.12.22. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9d643efe7d7e9cc8","sum":"uv lock --locked without --refresh accepts a pytorch-index lock as current, so the root docs lock uses --no-config --refresh. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only handoff to query.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260913T191535Z-13e9bab5c49f07d0","text":"uv lock --locked without --refresh treats a pytorch-index lock as current; root docs lock must use --no-config --refresh.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T193807Z-4efc5d97f1279b70","text":"stockroom semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only shape that can hand off to query.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20fe4911ab451244","sum":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked; uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision to 3. CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194958Z-1341312456d701ec","text":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked. uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision back to 3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T195915Z-9e5f10b38f9fb742","text":"CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c53d131b7fa46813","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW, so semantic --harness/--role rank the joined set; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query. chore(semantic)! (ids before role) cut 2.0.0. BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated notice; other _http warnings log.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d133a7aa26b2284c","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: a harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows. Semantic tsv/table put session_id and message_id before role, a breaking shift marked chore(semantic)! so release-please cut 2.0.0.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T180756Z-1e00dec009646749","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: embeddings harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows while matches exist.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T181638Z-94dbcd6e44d4af97","text":"Default semantic tsv and table insert session_id and message_id before role. That shift is breaking: marker commit chore(semantic)! so release-please cuts 2.0.0, not 1.3.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8b5dfc860fd2304a","sum":"semantic --harness/--role rank embeddings joined to messages; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query (DuckDB VSS post-filters it). BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated-request notice; other huggingface_hub _http warnings, incl. failed downloads, still log.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T195045Z-3d49f28ec61f9e73","text":"stockroom semantic --harness and --role rank embeddings joined to messages. Do not add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query; DuckDB VSS post-filters that shape.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204959Z-929c764401ba7c67","text":"BgeEncoder drops the Hub unauthenticated-request notice. Other huggingface_hub.utils._http warnings, including a failed download, still log.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c58802e6a3337267","sum":"Docs omit semantic --harness/--role. Claude tokens once per (message.id, requestId); subagent copies carry none; vanished rows stay. subagentInfo stamps children; Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. .git and Makefile are not dev markers; only a dead shim is replaced.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"378a965d09cd0cf8","sum":"Human pages omit semantic --harness/--role (home: sr-semantic SKILL.md). Claude tokens: once per (message.id, requestId), field max; subagent copies carry none; vanished rows stay. Cursor CLI subagents: subagentInfo parentAgentId/toolCallId/typeName; spawn CallDynamicTool Task.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e0aca5420853595c","sum":"Human pages omit semantic --harness/--role (flag home: sr-semantic SKILL.md). Claude message tokens stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; subagent copies of a parent response carry none; vanished transcripts are not rewritten.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220128Z-48f450097d0ca431","text":"Human pages do not list semantic --harness or --role. Flag home is skills/sr-semantic/SKILL.md; the sr-search route row and the two-path sentence stay.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T164010Z-c6c38050580988bb","text":"Claude message tokens are stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; a subagent copy of a parent response carries none. Transcripts that are gone are not rewritten.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7fd1420334a977b2","sum":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored (message.id/requestId never persisted; gaps between equal cache triples occur in one response). Cursor CLI subagent children: meta.subagentInfo parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName; spawn is CallDynamicTool namespace=cursor toolName=Task.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T193126Z-43be936f55bee97c","text":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored: message.id and requestId were never persisted, and a user row or time gap between equal cache triples also occurs inside one response.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T014749Z-e1cebfcb88bd6cfa","text":"Cursor CLI subagents: child meta.subagentInfo has parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName. Parent spawn is CallDynamicTool args namespace=cursor toolName=Task, not a tool named Task. CLI ingest ignores subagentInfo, so no dashboard inset.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"740564f94144b5c0","sum":"Stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo. Task slots: CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. .git and Makefile are not dev markers; rectify replaces a dead shim only. Owner: default plugin dirs by path; a checkout is dev; elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT means cursor, else Claude asks.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"15791adfd675f0b1","sum":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo; dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. Plugin cache copies hold .git and Makefile, not dev markers. rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign or unknown files stay.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T022227Z-ccb5b17bf805c62a","text":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo (parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName). Dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task; children with a spawn id join before the zip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T195949Z-b101405aa74423ff","text":"Marketplace plugin copies (Claude and Cursor caches) contain .git and Makefile: neither marks a dev checkout. shim rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign shims and unidentified files stay untouched.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"05faf29885d0e87f","sum":"sr-initialize owner: default plugin dirs by path (cache/synced = claude/cursor); a checkout load is dev. Elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT means cursor, else Claude asks. A substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof. Agent shells never get that env; skill text gets the exact token.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T195949Z-c42d3773b4d4c55f","text":"sr-initialize owner: engine under .../cache/<mkt>/<plugin>/<ver> (or Claude synced/) is claude/cursor; any checkout load (--plugin-dir, Cursor plugins/local, mirror) is dev. Agent shells never get plugin-root env; Claude substitutes exact ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} in skill text.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T215531Z-8195092923e19a0d","text":"sr-initialize owner: path decides in default plugins dirs (.claude/plugins/cache|synced, .cursor/plugins/cache); elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT holding the engine is cursor, else Claude Code asks. Substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof: --plugin-dir substitutes checkouts.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
